msgid "Enter math navigation mode"
msgstr "进入数学导航模式"

#. Translators: Orca has a modal math navigation mode powered by MathCAT
#. (https://daisy.github.io/MathCAT). This command exits that mode.
#: src/orca/cmdnames.py:1187
